A computed mapping calling a function outside the set the totality proof
proves.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	name: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	name:  string
	label: string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		label: strings.Title(v0_0.name)
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0357]: strings.Title is not a function a lens may call
 --> 1.0.thema:9:10
  |
9 |         label: strings.Title(v0_0.name)
  |                ^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: the strings functions a lens may call are strings.Contains, strings.HasPrefix, strings.HasSuffix, strings.Replace, strings.ToLower, strings.ToUpper, strings.Trim, strings.TrimLeft, strings.TrimPrefix, strings.TrimRight, strings.TrimSpace, strings.TrimSuffix
